<title>USA: Chateau reaffirms ROC combination.</title>
<headline>Chateau reaffirms ROC combination.</headline>
<dateline>CLINTON TOWNSHIP, Mich. 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chateau Properties Inc on Thursday said it reaffirmed its commitment to a combination with ROC Communities Inc in its response to a bid from Manufactured Home Communities Inc.</p>
<p>The company's response stated that its board found a combination with ROC to be &quot;a clearly superior alternative&quot; and &quot;determined that it would not be appropriate to enter into discussions&quot; with Manufactured Homes.</p>
</text>
